OL,3,GNEWSA'When I found out about Breast
OL,4,AFriends it was the best thing ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnette Farrington-Moore says a charity
OL,7,Fbecame a lifeline after her breast
OL,8,Fcancer diagnosis, and now the group
OL,9,Fthat helped her is celebrating a major
OL,10,Fmilestone with a royal seal of
OL,11,Fapproval.
OL,13,FRun by volunteers with lived experience
OL,14,Fof the disease, Breast Friends Solihull
OL,15,Fprovides emotional and practical
OL,16,Fsupport with many involved forging
OL,17,Flifelong friendships.
OL,19,F"You don't want to trouble family and
OL,20,Fthey don't really understand what
OL,21,Fyou're going through emotionally," she
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
